{"title":"Statistical Computing Prac 1","markdown":{"headingText":"Statistical Computing Prac 1","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n## Question 1\n\n```{r}\n#| echo: false\n\ndf <- airquality\n\n## Identify rows with missing values\n\nmissing_rows <- df[rowSums(is.na(df))> 0,]\nprint(missing_rows)\n\n```\n\nThe table shows the missing values as obtained from the original data.\n\n## Question 2\n\n```{r}\n#| echo: false\n\nnew_df <- na.omit(df)  # Removing missing values\n\n## Mean\nmean(new_df$Temp)\nmean(new_df$Ozone)\n\n## StDev\nsd(new_df$Temp)\nsd(new_df$Ozone)\n\n## Max\nmax(new_df$Temp)\nmax(new_df$Ozone)\n\n## Min\nmin(new_df$Temp)\nmin(new_df$Ozone)\n```\n\n## Question 3\n\n```{r}\n#| echo: false\n\ndat <- cars\n\nX <- cbind(1,dat$speed) # Add a column of ones for intercept\nY <- dat$dist\n\nbeta <- solve(t(X)%*%X)%*%t(X)%*%Y\nfit <- lm(Y~X, data = dat)\nsummary(fit)\n\nbeta\n```\n\n```{r}\n#| echo: false\n\n# function to calculate the relevant statistics\n\nf <- function(X,Y){\n  beta <- solve(t(X)%*%X)%*%t(X)%*%Y\n  stdev <- 1/48*t(Y-X%*%beta)%*%(Y-X%*%beta)\n  covr <- as.numeric(stdev)*solve(t(X)%*%X)\n  se_beta <- sqrt(diag(covr))\n  t_stat0 <- beta[1,]/se_beta[1]\n  t_stat1 <- beta[2,]/se_beta[2]\n  p_val0 <- 2*(pt(q = t_stat0,df = 48, lower.tail = FALSE))\n  p_val1 <- 2*(pt(q = t_stat1,df = 48, lower.tail = FALSE)) ##Issues with p value\n  \n  return(list('coefficients'= beta,'t_stat'= c(t_stat0,t_stat1),'p-values'= c(p_val0,p_val1)))\n  \n}\n\nb_values <- f(X,Y)\n```\n\nThe analysis shows that the calculated Beta values are consistent with the values obtained from the lm function.\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":n